        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever watched Disney’s animated movie "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Bambi"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "动画电影《小鹿斑比》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Bambi is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "white-tailed deer",
            "zh": "白尾鹿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This type of deer is one of the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "numerous",
            "ref": "v-numerous"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " types in the world. White-tailed deer, as well as many other types of deer, have "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spots",
            "ref": "v-spot"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on their backs when they are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Do you know why?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A newborn baby deer is very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Its spots help "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "prevent",
            "ref": "v-prevent"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the newborn from being "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "predators",
            "zh": "捕食者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In the forest, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " falls on the plants and the forest floor. The white spots on the baby deer’s back look just like the spots of light. This makes the baby deer "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blend in with",
            "ref": "v-blend-in-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " its environment and helps keep it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The spots also help break up the deer’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", making it harder for predators to recognize it as prey."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the movie, Bambi’s spots "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " as it grows up. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Similarly",
            "ref": "v-similarly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", most other types of deer lose their spots around three or four months old. However, some types of deer "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " lose their spots, such as the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sika deer",
            "zh": "梅花鹿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They keep this cute and helpful gift from nature "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their lives. Isn’t it amazing how nature provides "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what animals need to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "survive",
            "ref": "v-survive"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      }
